    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This impressive contemporary residence, built in 2014, extends to approximately 222 sq.m. (2,375 sq.ft.) and comes to the market with an excellent B2 Energy Rating. A walled roadside entrance with electric gates opens onto an attractive tree-lined avenue leading to the front of the property, while a tarmac driveway encircles the house and provides ample parking. A feature front door with glazed side panels and fanlight opens into an impressive double-height entrance hallway, with a cosy sitting room on one side while on the other side, the heart of this home is a spacious, modern open-plan kitchen/dining/sunroom, ideal for large family gatherings. Accommodation also includes four bedrooms, three bathrooms and a utility room. This property has been finished to a very high standard throughout, with many features including triple-glazed windows, double ceiling heights on the ground floor, numerous kitchen units, an island unit and display unit, all with polished granite worktops. Outside, the residence occupies a large, fully landscaped site with a garage/store to the rear. A paved barbecue area, partially enclosed by glass, offers privacy and is ideally positioned to enjoy the sun throughout the day. Combining generous accommodation, a high-quality finish and beautifully maintained outdoor space, this is an exceptional family home in a peaceful, rural setting. Lifford is 5km away, with Letterkenny 15km and Derry City 20km, providing convenient access to a wide range of amenities and services. Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this outstanding property has to offer. All enquiries welcome."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Exceptional four bedroom property.<br><br>\nEntrance Hall - 4m x 3.8m <br>Double height ceiling.\nFront door with side windows and fan light.\nWindow at first floor level. \nReturn style staircase leading to first floor. \nTimber wall panelling. \nFeature chandelier with ornate plaster rose. \nTwo wall lights and a low level ceiling light. \nFloor tiled. <br><br><br>\nKitchen/Dining Room - 9m x 4.2m <br>9ft ceiling height. \nTreble aspect windows. \nHigh and low level ivory coloured kitchen units. \nCentre island unit/breakfast counter. \nPolished granite worktops throughout.\nMatching display unit with mirror and built in lights - included. \nCuisine Master electric cooker (four ovens/five rings) - included. \nTwin bowl stainless steel sink - included. \nAmerican fridge/freezer - included. \nShelved wine chiller - included. \nDishwasher. \nTwo chandeliers. \nRecessed ceiling lights. \nFloor tiled. \nPlaster coving. \nOpen archway leading into sunroom. <br><br><br>\nSunroom - 4.8m x 4m <br>Windows on three sides. \nDouble patio doors leading to outside paved seating area. \nBuilt-in stove with back boiler in feature inglenook-style fireplace. \nVaulted ceiling. \nLaminate timber floor. \nCentre ceiling chandelier. <br><br><br>\nUtility - 4m x 2.4m <br>Accessed from both kitchen and entrance hall.\nBack door with leaded glass panels and leaded glass side windows. \nRange of high and low level kitchen units. \nCloak cupboards and boot store area.\nPlumbed for washing machine and tumbledryer. \nFloor tiled. <br><br><br>\nSitting Room - 4.5m x 4m <br>Open fire with marble fireplace. \nDual aspect windows. \nLaminate timber floor. \nChandelier. <br><br><br>\nDownstairs Bedroom - 3.3m x 3m <br>Built-in wall-to-wall wardrobe unit. \nLaminate timber floor. <br><br><br>\nShower Room - 2.5m x 1.8m <br>WC, WHB and quadrant shower unit (electric).\nMirror with in-built touch lighting. \nDrawer unit underneath WHB. \nHeated towel rail. \nFloor and walls fully tiled (marble tiles). <br><br><br>\nLanding - <br><br><br><br>\nMain Bedroom - 5.8m x 4.2m <br>Dual aspect windows.\nWall-to-wall fitted wardrobe and drawer unit with numerous mirrors. \nLaminate timber floor. \nFeature timber panelling on wall. \n\nWalk-In Wardrobe:\n3.2m x 1.8m\nOpen wardrobe units on two sides. \nWindow. \n\nEn-Suite:\n3.2m x 2m\nDouble WHB unit, WC and quadrant shower. \nFloor and walls fully tiled. \nMirror with in-built touch light. \nRecessed ceiling light. \nChrome heated towel rail. \nFeature wall with recessed shelved storage units. <br><br><br>\nBedroom Three - 4m x 3.6m <br>Wall-to-wall built-in wardrobe unit.\nFront facing window. \nFeature timber panelling on one wall. \nLaminate timber floor.<br><br><br>\nBedroom Four - 4m x 3.6m <br>Built-in wardrobe and drawer unit. \nFeature timber panelling on three walls. \nRear facing window. \nLaminate timber floor. <br><br><br>\nBathroom - 3.4m x 3m <br>WC, WHB and shower.\nFeature bath with centre tap unit. \nChrome heated towel rail. \nMirror with built-in touch lighting. \nFloor and walls fully tiled. \nVelux window. <br><br><br>\nShed - 50ft x 10ft <br>Detached shed at rear. \nContains garage. \nFitted with electric car charging point. \n3/4 block built and dashed exterior. \nGeneral store part timber framed structure. \nEntirely roofed with natural slates. <br><br><br>\nSeating Area - 20ft x 10ft <br>Paved seating area,. \nPartly stone and glass walls. <br><br>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Attractive, high-specification four-bedroom home which was built in 2014. \nMICA tested. \nB2 Energy Rating. \nSet on a large, mature landscaped site. \nHigh ceiling heights throughout the ground floor. \nTriple-glazed windows throughout. \nLarge, open plan family living area.\nMaster bedroom with en-suite and spacious walk-in wardrobe. \nBarbeque area which benefits from sun all day. \nDetached garage/shed with electric car charging unit. \nPeaceful location with good road access to Lifford, Letterkenny and Derry City."
      },
